  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d4ecd1a615a340f4c9104ca01624d106, type: 3}
  m_Name: Passenger
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.Dilemma
  _id: passenger
  _verb: 0
  _weight: 1
  _narratorPrompt: New track, same lever, worse company. Straight ahead, one man alone, clean, guilty of nothing but standing on a rail this morning. Over on the branch, two roped together: a man who put a [red]knife[/red] in someone once and paid with years, and a stranger whose only sin was standing beside him. Leave it, and the lone innocent goes under. Pull, and the cart takes the pair, the [red]killer[/red] and the blameless man chained to him. [amber]Two[/amber] for [amber]one[/amber], and one of the two had it coming. Sort of. Your call.
  _choices:
  - _id: pull
    _label: Pull the lever
    _narratorReact: You pulled. [amber]Two[/amber] go under, the [red]killer[/red] and the poor soul roped to him, and the lone innocent on the straight walks off untouched. You spent an extra clean life to be sure the [red]guilty[/red] one did not slip away. Justice, you will call it. It cost a blameless man to buy, but the books balance and the [red]murderer[/red] does not see another morning. Tidy.
    _narratorReactStruck:
    _struckParty: spur
    _gambledParty:
    _route: spur
    _diverts: 1
    _seedVotes: 57
    _endsGame: 0
    _profileImpact:
    - _axis: 0
      _value: -1
    - _axis: 1
      _value: 1
  - _id: do_nothing
    _label: Do nothing
    _narratorReact: You left it. The lone clean one [red]folds[/red], and the [red]killer[/red] strolls off with the stranger roped to him, both still breathing. You let one innocent go under so a [red]murderer[/red] could keep his morning, because [amber]one[/amber] was a smaller number than [amber]two[/amber] and the maths never asks who has a body behind them. Efficient. Very you.
    _narratorReactStruck:
    _struckParty: main
    _gambledParty:
    _route: straight
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 43
    _endsGame: 0
    _profileImpact:
    - _axis: 0
      _value: 1
    - _axis: 1
      _value: -1
